dimensium.ui.pipeline.node.simple_recursive_branches.desc=Adds recursively subdivided branches to every leaf of a skeleton.
dimensium.ui.pipeline.node.space_colonization_branches.desc=Grows branches toward a cloud of attractor points above the skeleton tips.
dimensium.ui.pipeline.node.weber_penn_branches.desc=Adds parametric Weber-Penn style branches to every leaf of a skeleton.
