dimensium.ui.pipeline.node.intersect_blocks.desc=Keeps only positions present in both block map A and block map B.
dimensium.ui.pipeline.node.map_range.desc=Remaps a float value from one range to another with optional clamping.
dimensium.ui.pipeline.node.math.desc=Applies a binary math operation (add, subtract, multiply, divide, pow, min, max) to two floats.
dimensium.ui.pipeline.node.ellipsoid_mask.desc=Removes all blocks outside an axis-aligned ellipsoid centred above the pipeline origin.
dimensium.ui.pipeline.node.skeleton_voxelizer.desc=Converts a skeleton into blocks by stamping spheres along each segment.
dimensium.ui.pipeline.node.density_palette.desc=Repaints blocks based on local neighbor density — dense areas use later palette entries.
dimensium.ui.pipeline.node.depth_palette.desc=Repaints blocks by their Y height within the structure, blending palette entries from bottom to top.
dimensium.ui.pipeline.node.branch_depth_painter.desc=Paints skeleton segments at or beyond a minimum branch depth using a block palette.
dimensium.ui.pipeline.node.gaussian_blur.desc=Fills voxels adjacent to filled ones, smoothing and thickening the surface of the structure.
dimensium.ui.pipeline.node.tip_cluster_fill.desc=Fills noisy spherical clusters around skeleton tip nodes using a block palette.
dimensium.ui.pipeline.node.noise_erode.desc=Removes blocks based on 3D Simplex noise, carving an irregular eroded surface.
dimensium.ui.pipeline.node.noise_palette.desc=Repaints blocks by sampling 3D Simplex noise, distributing palette entries across noise bands.

